<title>TANZANIA: 18 people killed in northern Tanzania bus crash.</title>
<headline>18 people killed in northern Tanzania bus crash.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1996-12-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>A total of 18 people were killed on Friday when two buses crashed head on in northern Tanzania between the towns of Arusha and Moshi, Tanzanian state radio said on Saturday.</p>
</text>
